the source
  version            the files on disk
  has                snapshot
  lacks              history, so page.date is not taken from it
the site
  site.format        `ink:format-markdown`    pinned in ink.toml, bytes 7..37
  site.root          the top of the snapshot  by default
  site.layout        a vault                  because .obsidian is there
.obsidian/app.json
  file.ignore        ignored                  because .obsidian is there
index.md
  file.ignore        kept                     by default
ink.toml
  file.ignore        ignored                  from the name of ink.toml
index.md
  page.publish       published                from the frontmatter of index.md, bytes 13..17
  page.kind          a page                   by default
  page.title         “Pinned vault”           from the frontmatter of index.md, bytes 25..37
  page.date          undated                  by default
  page.updated       never updated            by default
  page.slug          `index`                  from the name of index.md
  page.tags          no tags                  by default
  page.summary       “A vault whose pin says markdown: [[Other]] stays text and #todo is no tag.” from the text of index.md
the site
